### Test Web Search via Master Agent (v2 API)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v2/MasterAgent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Search the web for the latest news about artificial intelligence",
  "conversationId": "test-websearch-001"
}

### Test combining web search with financial advice
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v2/MasterAgent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are the current trends in AI technology? Then recommend tech funds from our portfolio that might benefit.",
  "conversationId": "test-websearch-002"
}

### Test financial query (should NOT use web search)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v2/MasterAgent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show me the details of portfolio PORT123",
  "conversationId": "test-websearch-003"
}

